# Old Netlify domain -> the TonFin domain. `:splat` carries the rest of the
# path, and `!` forces the rule even though a page exists at that address.
https://ton-tracker.netlify.app/*  https://tonfin.ton.id.vn/:splat  301!
http://ton-tracker.netlify.app/*   https://tonfin.ton.id.vn/:splat  301!

# Single-page app fallback. It has to stay last: every rule above is matched
# first, and this one would otherwise swallow them.
/*  /index.html  200
